        "text": "The training procedure of DUC is shown in Algorithm 1.\nAlgorithm 1 Pseudo code of the proposed DUC Input: labeled source dataset S, unlabeled target dataset T , selection steps R, total annotation\nbudget B, hyperparameters \u03ba, \u03b2, \u03bb, total training steps T . Output: learned model parameters \u03b8.\n1: Initialize model parameters \u03b8. 2: Define T l = \u2205 and T u = T , b = B|R| . 3: for t = 1 to T do 4: Update parameters \u03b8 via minimizing Ltotal. 5: if t \u2208 R then 6: \u2200xj \u2208 T u, compute its distribution and data uncertainties: Udis(xj ,\u03b8), Udata(xj ,\u03b8). 7: temp Candi\u2190 select top \u03bab samples with highest Udis from T u. 8: Candi\u2190 select top b samples with highest Udata from temp Candi. 9: Query the labels of Candi from the oracle.\n10: T u = T u\\Candi, T l = T l \u222a Candi. 11: end if 12: end for 13: return Final model parameters \u03b8."
